                            <comment id="16482061" author="andmed" created="Sun, 20 May 2018 22:14:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;PR &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4030&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4030&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16482072" author="andmed" created="Sun, 20 May 2018 23:18:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;TC:&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=1315393&amp;amp;&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=1315393&amp;amp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I can see&#160;one flaky test again&#160;there, remote node could not start:&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=1315393&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_StartNodes&amp;amp;tab=buildResultsDiv#testNameId6814497542781613621&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=1315393&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_StartNodes&amp;amp;tab=buildResultsDiv#testNameId6814497542781613621&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;not sure if&#160;this means that&#160;any longer timeout&#160; would help (now we have 30sec)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Here is clean run on TC&lt;/p&gt;

